     "type": "term",
     "def": "请保持尊重。"
    },
    {
     "w": "I appreciate your feedback.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "感谢你的反馈。"
    },
    {
     "w": "contribution guideline",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "贡献规则，项目接受贡献的具体要求"
    },
    {
     "w": "pull request template",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "拉取请求模板，提示贡献者填写必要信息"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. We discuss the risk around the code of conduct. I document the maintainer review so the team can review it later. If the maintainership fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the community guideline first. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"Let's keep the discussion focused.\" I reply, \"Everyone is welcome here.\" The guide is clear. The first outside contribution is merged.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. We discuss the risk around the code of conduct. I document the maintainer review so the team can review it later. If the maintainership fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the community guideline first. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"Let's keep the discussion focused.\" I reply, \"Everyone is welcome here.\" The guide is clear. The first outside contribution is merged.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我给团队写了一份简短的总结。我们讨论了行为准则相关的风险。我把维护者评审写成文档，方便团队之后查看。如果维护职责失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。我建议我们先检查社区准则。一天结束时，Maria说：\"让我们让讨论保持聚焦。\"我回答：\"这里欢迎每个人。\"指南很清楚。第一个外部贡献合并了。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "maintainership",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "维护职责，长期管理项目方向和质量的责任"
    },
    {
     "w": "community guideline",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "社区准则，规定参与者应遵守的行为方式"
    },
    {
     "w": "Let's keep the discussion focused.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "让我们让讨论保持聚焦。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Everyone is welcome here.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "这里欢迎每个人。"
    },
    {
     "w": "code of conduct",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "行为准则，规定社区成员应遵守的行为标准"
    },
    {
     "w": "maintainer review",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "维护者评审，由项目维护者进行的最终检查"
    }
   ]
